# Keep the server and optional features in one independently locked image graph. The production
# server requires SQL, GCS, basic-auth/workspaces, AI Gateway, and distributed budget state. The
# Linux/amd64 lock targets manylinux_2_28 wheels, which remain compatible with the pinned Debian
# Bookworm (glibc 2.36) base while permitting currently patched binary releases.
